 "is_vocab": false,
 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-idp13955696\" class=\"interactive\" data-label=\"\">\n<h3 class=\"os-title\" data-type=\"title\">\n  <span class=\"os-title-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h3>\n<div class=\"os-note-body\">\n<h4 data-type=\"title\" id=\"12\" class=\"os-subtitle\">\n  <span class=\"os-subtitle-label\">Link to Learning</span>\n</h4>\n<span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-idm35414704\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n<img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20220509.174553/resources/2ed6a71e8ee41433eb71c50f1b7780a43760646c\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" id=\"13\">\n</span>\n<p id=\"fs-idp149830720\">This <a href=\"https://openstaxcollege.org/l/misconceptions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">site</a> addresses some of the main misconceptions associated with the theory of evolution. </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
 "stimulus_html": "",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 233433,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Select one misconception about evolution and explain what you might say to someone to dispel it.",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 723875,
     "content_html": "Misconception: Evolution is not a well-founded theory. Correction: Although evolution cannot be observed occurring today, there is strong evidence in the fossil record and in shared DNA sequences to support the theory"
    },
    {
     "id": 723878,
     "content_html": "Misconception: Humans are not currently evolving. Correction: The environmental pressures humans face are different than the ones they faced several thousands of years ago, but they are still there, and they are still producing (slowly!) evolutionary change."
    },
    {
     "id": 723876,
     "content_html": "Misconception: Evolution produces individuals that are perfectly fit to their environment. Correction: Evolution produces random changes in the genetic code that sometimes lead to adaptations"
    },
    {
     "id": 723877,
     "content_html": "Misconception: Evolution is a random process. Correction: evolution is a force that makes animals adapt to perfectly fit the environment they are living in"
    }
   ],
   "hints": [],
